      en: ["Built on the site of the former Peck San Thew Cantonese cemetery.", "Name translates to 'Jade Hill' (Bi Shan) in Chinese.", "Bishan-Ang Mo Kio Park features a 3-km naturalized river.", "Home to Raffles Institution, one of Singapore's oldest schools.", "Distinctive HDB architecture with iconic pitched roofs.", "Junction 8 is the primary shopping mall at the town center."],
