      en: ["Named after Lim Nee Soon, the 'Pineapple King' of Singapore.", "Home to Northpoint City, the largest mall in Northern Singapore.", "Khoo Teck Puat Hospital is an award-winning green healthcare facility.", "Yishun Pond features a signature 14.5-meter high lookout tower.", "Historically a major center for rubber and pineapple cultivation.", "The town is served by the Yishun and Khatib MRT stations."],
      es: ["Northpoint City es el ancla más importante del centro de la ciudad.", "Yishun MRT se encuentra en la línea Norte-Sur.", "Yishun Pond es un espacio recreativo conocido.", "El embalse Lower Seletar se encuentra cerca del barrio.", "El hospital Khoo Teck Puat es un nombre central en el distrito.", "Yishun pertenece a las grandes zonas residenciales del norte de Singapur."],
